From: Vicki Pfau <vi@endrift.com>
Subject: [PATCH] HID: steam: backport 2026 Steam Controller support from 7.3

drivers/hid/hid-steam.c taken from v7.3-rc3, plus the new Valve device
IDs in hid-ids.h. Covers the for-7.3/steam series, including:

  0a80b4e8ec6a HID: steam: Initial 2026 Steam Controller support
  6f9b740c31ba HID: steam: Refactor registration
  2eb7cf02b521 HID: steam: Add support for sensor events on the Steam Controller (2015)
  1d4549fd1115 HID: steam: Coalesce rumble packets
  cd33a91d37eb HID: steam: Fully unregister controller when hidraw is opened
  de1d341b9b3e HID: steam: Clean up locking
  cfe8ee25fe12 HID: steam: Zero out inputs when disabling gamepad mode

